WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.406
You've completed the Harbor.

2
00:00:01.406 --> 00:00:10.197
A few things to carry forward: U.S. buyers often interpret unusually low pricing as lower quality, stay within the competitive range and differentiate on value.

3
00:00:10.197 --> 00:00:16.174
Speed is a trust signal in U.S. sales, same-day responses are often the expectation, not the exception.

4
00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:22.503
Vendor onboarding can delay payment for weeks, prepare your W-9, insurance, and banking details before you start selling.

5
00:00:22.503 --> 00:00:28.480
When you're ready, head back to your dashboard and pick the topic you want to explore next.
